Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.74,0:23:49.45,EDCN,,0,0,145,,{\blur5\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\t(-25,135,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H222222&)}每個尋常的朝夕因為有你
